                <h3 class="postingHeader">Department Information</h3>

                <div class="postingContent">
		
                    <p style="text-align: left; margin: 0pt 0pt 6pt; line-height: 1.07917;"><span style="font-family: Arial;"><span style="font-size: 12pt;">Department of Developmental Services is a California state agency providing services and support to over 450,000 individuals with intellectual and developmental disabilities (I/DD), including cerebral palsy, intellectual disability, autism, epilepsy, and related conditions.<br /></span></span><span style="font-family: Arial; font-size: 12pt;"><br />Canyon Springs is located in Cathedral City, Riverside County, 110 miles southeast of Los Angeles in the Coachella Valley. Recreation/cultural attractions include golf, tennis, desert preserves, parks, rock climbing, hiking, biking, museums, art galleries, and theater. Next door is well-known city of Palm Springs. Although known as a winter resort area, increasing numbers are making the Coachella Valley their year-round home. There are&nbsp;schools&nbsp;and shopping nearby.</span></p><p style="text-align: left; margin: 0pt;"><span style="font-family: Arial; font-size: 12pt;">&nbsp;</span></p><p style="text-align: left; margin: 0pt;"><span style="font-family: Arial; font-size: 12pt;">Facility Website:&nbsp;<a href="https://www.dds.ca.gov/services/state-facilities/canyon-springs/" style="text-decoration: none;"><span style="color: #0000ff; text-decoration: underline;">Canyon Springs : CA Department of Developmental Services</span></a></span></p><p style="text-align: left; margin: 0pt 0pt 6pt; line-height: 1.07917;"><span style="font-family: Arial;"><span style="font-size: 12pt;"> </span></span></p>
                
	</div>

                <div id="pnlDepartmentWebsite" class="postingContent paddingTop10">
		
                    Department Website:
                    <a id="hlDepartmentWebsite" href="http://www.dds.ca.gov" target="_blank">http://www.dds.ca.gov</a>
                    
                
	</div>

